{"parse": {"title": "世界上最小的涟漪-08", "pageid": 147258, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA-07\" title=\"世界上最小的涟漪-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">世界上最小的涟漪-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">世界上最小的涟漪</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BA.B2.E7.88.B1.E7.9A.84.E4.BC.BD.E7.90.B3.E6.B6.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"亲爱的伽琳涅\">亲爱的伽琳涅</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 亲爱的伽琳涅</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Dear Galene</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_21\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_bg_21.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_bg_21.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_bg_21.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯，我总觉得我的生活不该是这个样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>族中最小的宁芙输了她的第一场比赛，她垂头丧气，耳鳍也像蔫了的花瓣。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_bangongshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-2_7_bg_bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-2_7_bg_bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-2_7_bg_bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>纳西索斯，你想过什么样的生活？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我想……我想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一脸烦恼，艰难地在自己的脑海中寻找明确的参照物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我想像赫多涅那样活着！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_23.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_23\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_23\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-3_9_at_23.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_23.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-3_9_at_23.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_23.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-3_9_at_23.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_23.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>岛上有她的壁画，上面画着她征战提丰的故事，从以前到现在，大家都在传颂她的故事。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_05\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_9_at_05.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_9_at_05.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_9_at_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315722.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315722.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>赫多涅多威风啊！还有数不尽的财富围绕着她，她的身上一直都闪闪发光。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_02\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_9_at_02.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_9_at_02.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_9_at_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315722.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315722.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>如果我可以像她一样就好了……但是我不知道该怎么做。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_21\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_bg_21.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_bg_21.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_bg_21.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯，你能告诉我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起眼睛，满心希望族中最见多识广的长辈能给予她答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>岛上的君主确实是一个很好的榜样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>长辈的手轻轻摩挲宁芙的头发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>不过我觉得纳西索斯——或者说，我们的小伽琳涅，也毫不逊色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被提及了本名的宁芙因夸奖而喜不自胜，但困惑并未完全褪去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她仍旧渴望一个真正的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯，你的意思是不是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>只要我不放弃打败赫多涅，在不久的将来，我就一定能拿下胜利？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我会打败她的，对吧？对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她被这样的想象激励，撒娇一般地摇着长辈的手臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>伽琳涅，你想这么做吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我、我想！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我一直都想……多里斯！到时候你一定要来看！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>看我站到最高的领奖台上，举起冠军奖杯——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>等到那个时候，我的生活肯定就和现在完全不一样了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙安静了下来，仅仅是这样一声轻柔的呼唤，已经让她有了一种奇异的预感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>我已感受到我的期限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>什、什么期限？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脸霎时变得苍白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>生命的期限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯，你是说……你是说你会……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她无论如何也说不出那个字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她最敬爱的族长用惯常的语调说出这个词语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>不！不不不不！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙吓得捂住了自己的耳朵，耳鳍也被揉皱，蜷缩在掌心之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可是多里斯从不说谎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意识到这一点，纳西索斯忍不住啜泣起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我不要这样，多里斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>它并不可怕，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>而且，无论泉水宁芙的生命有多长，死亡都是必然的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我不想要你死去，多里斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她只能徒劳地、心碎地哭泣着，直到多里斯牵起她的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>没关系，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>死亡是世界上最后的、也是最小的涟漪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>纳西索斯，你应当在这涟漪到来之前……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_31.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_31\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_31\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-3_9_at_31.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_31.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-3_9_at_31.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_31.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-3_9_at_31.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_31.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>有了项链，我以后就可以在比赛之中所向披靡了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>你想好要怎么用了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>唔，还没有！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>不过现在我有了项链，有了神谕，还有多里斯最后和我说的话——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她仰头看向无比广袤的天空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>荷米斯，这些都让我想通了一件事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>信使十分乐意倾听您对生活的新见解！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯说过的那个故事——很久之前，在迁徙至火山岛的路上，泉水宁芙曾在海盗手上救下过一位先知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我在想——那位先知会不会就是多里斯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>你是说，多里斯曾经被海盗绑架了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>不不，我的意思是说，并不存在一位曾被海盗绑架的先知！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>自始至终，只有一个在海浪之中寻找着方向的泉水宁芙，她并没有收获一个陌生先知的指引。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>她是第一个跃向海面的泉水宁芙，她也成为了自己的先知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>不过，这也只是我的猜测！多里斯说这些只是故事，只是我一直相信它们是真实存在的历史。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>如今，我也无从证实了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她展开了手中的地图，看到上面有了一些崭新的变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>共同的旅程里，那些行走过的地方具象在纸面之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315719.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-315719.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315719.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315719.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-315719.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315719.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-315719.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315719.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>不过——我的旅行才刚刚开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻轻摩挲着纸张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我还有很多时间，去想象多里斯的旅程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>当然，现在首要的目标，是返回火山岛，去和赫多涅一较高下！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_31.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_31\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_31\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-3_9_at_31.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_31.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-3_9_at_31.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_31.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-3_9_at_31.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_31.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>那等你打败赫多涅之后，你要做什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>分管一些岛上的事务？或者共享赫多涅殿下的财富？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>我相信赫多涅殿下不会吝啬她的奖赏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信使在宁芙未来的蓝图上添了极具吸引力的一笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>唔——这个我也不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我还没有想那么远的事情呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>现在，我只要眼下的胜利——而它只是开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙仰着头，在风中答道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_06\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_9_at_06.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_9_at_06.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_9_at_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轿车平行于摩托车而行，预言者的声音悠悠传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>你要知道，你找到的这条项链——它非常珍贵，独一无二。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-315721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-315721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-315721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>那当然！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>我只是想提醒你，我们那尊敬的岛上君主恰好也是一位品位不俗的收藏家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>公正的裁判手握方向盘，瞥了副驾驶上的同伴一眼，意味深长。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_31.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_31\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_31\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-3_9_at_31.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_31.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-3_9_at_31.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_31.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-3_9_at_31.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_31.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>是啊，你可千万要藏好了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>赫多涅对宝藏的嗅觉可是很敏锐的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>放心，放心！我一定会让它好好戴在我的脖子上！哪里也去不了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_tiankong1\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_tiankong1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙朝着天空说道，此刻有风掠过，仿佛将她的话语从这里携向天际。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一秒，她的心充盈着期待，那是一种无与伦比的舒展。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_35.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_35\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_35\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_at_35.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_35.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_at_35.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_35.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_at_35.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_35.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>纳西索斯啊！你应当在那涟漪到来之前……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-315721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-315721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-315721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>去掀起惊涛骇浪！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "世界上最小的涟漪-08"}}